@title Welcome to Customer Success
@subtitle For the November 2026 cohort
@author Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success

Hello, and welcome to Larkspur Software!

You are joining a team of 42 people spread across Denver, Dublin and Singapore. Between us we cover nearly every hour of the working day, and we share one job: making sure our customers get real value from what we build. We are glad you are here, and we have planned your first weeks so you can settle in without guessing what comes next.

## Your first week
- **Monday:** laptop pickup at 09:00, then a welcome breakfast.
- **Tuesday:** a product deep dive with the Solutions team.
- **Wednesday:** shadow two customer calls.
- **Thursday:** support tooling training.
- **Friday:** lunch with your onboarding buddy.

## Your first 90 days
**By day 30**, your focus is learning the product. Use it the way our customers do, sit in on calls, and ask why things work the way they do. Nobody expects you to have answers yet.

**By day 60**, you will own five accounts alongside your buddy. You will lead the conversations, and your buddy will be there to back you up and talk through what went well afterward.

**By day 90**, you will run quarterly business reviews on your own. By then you will know your accounts, our product and our playbook well enough to make those meetings genuinely useful to customers.

## People to know
- **Nadia Farouk**, VP of Customer Success
- **Owen Achterberg**, Head of Support
- **Priyanka Rao**, Enablement lead

! **Tip:** the `#cs-newbies` channel is the best place to ask anything. No question is too small.

We cannot wait to see what you bring to the team. Welcome aboard.

Warmly,
Nadia Farouk
VP of Customer Success
